228
00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.481
Ayuh, cari masa anda.

229
00:10:50.183 --> 00:10:51.885
Lemparkan tumbukan awak, Sellchan.

230
00:10:51.951 --> 00:10:54.053
[peserta 1]
Red corner memanggilnya.

231
00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:57.257
[Youngwoong] Pada ketika itu, saya fikir,
