248
00:11:38.598 --> 00:11:40.333
[seru peserta]

249
00:11:41.601 --> 00:11:43.336
[peserta 3]
Dia membunuhnya dengan kirinya.

250
00:11:45.939 --> 00:11:48.508
[peserta 1] Dia membaling dengan adil
