251
00:11:49.075 --> 00:11:51.110
Dia tidak menggunakan tangan belakangnya.

252
00:11:52.912 --> 00:11:54.180
Tetapi tangan kiri itu.

253
00:11:54.681 --> 00:11:56.616
[Sellchan] Secara jujur,
Saya mula-mula terdesak,

254
00:11:57.183 --> 00:11:59.219
