00:17:52.905 --> 00:17:53.906
Teruskan menolak.

386
00:17:54.407 --> 00:17:56.809
[Jongkook] Teruskan. Pergi, sekarang!

387
00:17:56.876 --> 00:17:58.844
Saya akan beri awak lima saat lagi.

388
00:17:59.345 --> 00:18:00.980
