594
00:27:48.333 --> 00:27:49.334
[peserta 1] Myung Hyunman?

595
00:27:50.402 --> 00:27:52.171
[peserta 2] Jung Dowoon!

596
00:27:54.139 --> 00:27:56.441
Myung Hyunman dari sudut merah!

597
00:27:57.809 --> 00:27:58.877
{\an8}Tahniah!

598
00:27:58.944 --> 00:28:00.179
{\an8}SUDUT MERAH
MYUNG HYUNMAN SELAMAT

